            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca La Vong",
            "review_text": "Lucbaison\nDüsseldorf, Germany7 contributions\n0\nSimply disappointing!\nJun 2026 • Couples\nI was here 20 years ago, and it was a highlight.\nNow it is the opposite - a definite distinction is made between locals and tourists. Not all ingredients are provided, and smaller portions are served. Locals receive fish and vegetables with an empty pan, tourists do not. There is only one toilet, which is dirty and cannot be locked.\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten June 1, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
